        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Expand and simplify <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (y + 5)(y - 2).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Expand and simplify [MATH: (y + 5)(y - 2).]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(y + 5)(y - 2) &amp;= \\\ny(y-2) + 5(y-2) &amp;=\\\ny^2-2y +5y-10 &amp;=\\\ny^2 + 3y - 10\n}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(y + 5)(y - 2) &= \\\ny(y-2) + 5(y-2) &=\\\ny^2-2y +5y-10 &=\\\ny^2 + 3y - 10\n}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpand and simplify [MATH: (y + 5)(y - 2).]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n[MATH: \\eqalign{\n(y + 5)(y - 2) &= \\\ny(y-2) + 5(y-2) &=\\\ny^2-2y +5y-10 &=\\\ny^2 + 3y - 10\n}]"
      },
